<title>AUSTRALIA: Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - July 28.</title>
<headline>Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - July 28.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Friday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     RIC	Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Mt Leyshon Gold	15.34     1.63</p>
<p> 2   Cudgen R.Z.	    10.42     2.40</p>
<p> 3   Natl Consol	    10.34     0.87</p>
<p> 4   Aust Tour		 9.49     0.79</p>
<p> 5   Prime Credit Tr	 9.27     1.05</p>
<p> 6   Prop Income Inv	 9.01     1.12</p>
<p> 7   Davids Limited	  9.01     1.11</p>
<p> 8   BT Prop Trust	   8.63     1.89</p>
<p> 9   Sea World Prop	  8.44     1.41</p>
<p>10   Indu Property	   8.24     1.03</p>
<p>11   Centro Prop	     8.12     2.37</p>
<p>12   Colonial Mutual	 7.96     1.34</p>
<p>13   Countrywide-PP	  7.94     1.28</p>
<p>14   Schroder Prop	   7.94     2.33</p>
<p>15   Villa World	     7.81     1.28</p>
